---
import "../styles/global.css";
import "../styles/project-card-featured.css"
import "../styles/project-card-dual.css"
---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Emil Brunsnes</title>
	</head>

<article class="project-card project-card--blue">
	<h2 class="project-card__title">The Canvas</h2>

	<div class="project-card__demo">
		<!-- Add your project demo here -->
	</div>

	<div class="project-card__content">
		<div class="project-card__copy">
			<h3 class="project-card__question">
			How might we bring students together on campus?
			</h3>

		<p class="project-card__description">
			We investigated sources of student stress by observing, interviewing, and codesigning with students. We came up with the Canvas, a collaborative artwork. 
		</p>
  		</div>

		<div class="project-card__actions">
			<a class="project-card__link" href="#">Read the portfolio</a>
			<a class="project-card__link" href="#">Watch the video pitch</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</article>

<article class="project-card project-card--pink">
	<h2 class="project-card__title">Gizmo</h2>

	<div class="project-card__demo">
		<!-- Add your project demo here -->
	</div>

	<div class="project-card__content">
		<div class="project-card__copy">
			<h3 class="project-card__question">
			Work in progress
			</h3>

		<p class="project-card__description">
			The brief - "something that moves". In a team of 2, we are making a synthesiser controlled by hand shadows with a marble machine controlling rhythm.  
		</p>
  		</div>

		<div class="project-card__actions">
			<a class="project-card__link" href="#">Read the portfolio</a>
			<a class="project-card__link" href="#">Watch the video pitch</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</article>

<div class="dual-project-grid">
  <article class="dual-project-card dual-project-card--sewing">
    <h2 class="dual-project-card__title">REVENG</h2>
    <p class="dual-project-card__description">Materials and manufacturing analysis, teardown, and redesign of a portable sewing machine. Includes a comprehensive ecological analysis.</p>
    <div class="dual-project-card__demo"></div>
  </article>

  <article class="dual-project-card dual-project-card--heart">
    <h2 class="dual-project-card__title">Heart disease predictor</h2>
    <p class="dual-project-card__description">Deep learning pipeline analysing heart disease in men.</p>
    <div class="dual-project-card__demo"></div>
  </article>
</div>

</html>
